2026-10-18T01:04:18.7291008Z   ok   the watchdog can be switched off entirely
2026-10-18T01:04:18.7291325Z   ok   the age limit can be relaxed
2026-10-18T01:04:18.7291644Z   ok   a future-stamped state is stale, not age 0
