2026-10-18T01:04:18.8216205Z -- solve anchor snaps to the quarter grid (coordinator path)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8216480Z   ok   12:07:33 floors to 12:00:00 with tz and date intact
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8216620Z   ok   a boundary instant is its own anchor
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8216844Z   ok   optimize() receives the snapped anchor, not the raw 12:07 instant
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8217077Z   ok   every published plan timestamp lands on a :00/:15/:30/:45 boundary
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8217363Z   ok   step 0's price is the quarter in force at 12:07 — the 12:00 hour's
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8217589Z   ok   the wall-clock action lookup lands on step 0, no pre-horizon clamp
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8217762Z   ok   filed lead promises mature on quarter boundaries
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8218003Z   ok   an override expiring 12:05 still pins the [12:00, 12:15) step at 12:07
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8218180Z   ok   and frees every step starting at or past the expiry
