2026-10-18T01:04:18.8218832Z   ok   15/30/60-minute snaps match the old keys exactly, fold included
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8219031Z   ok   the 25-hour autumn day meters 25 distinct 60-minute windows
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8219328Z   ok   120-minute windows advance the hour on the fold day (0,0,2,2,4,4,…)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8219526Z   ok   and on the gap day, straight through the missing wall hour
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8219701Z   ok   a 12:10 and a 13:30 sample share one 120-minute window
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8219886Z   ok   elapsed inside a 120-minute window can exceed an hour
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8220095Z   ok   the window closes on the 2-hour boundary, not every wall hour
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8220300Z   ok   window_factors samples 12:00/14:00/16:00, not 13:00/15:00/17:00
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8220308Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8220451Z -- planning grid on DST days (#243)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8220634Z   ok   all six transition days align prices to real instants
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8220768Z   ok   the plain day stays a zero null
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8220973Z   ok   _forecast_arrays and _price_series agree on the spring grid
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8221140Z   ok   _Horizon.timestamps invents no spring phantom
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8221389Z   ok   one horizon clock: the coordinator's import IS the optimizer's
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8221579Z   ok   coordinator and optimizer stamp the same spring grid
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8221784Z   ok   and on a step that is not a whole number of minutes (spring)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8221964Z   ok   coordinator and optimizer stamp the same autumn grid
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8222157Z   ok   and on a step that is not a whole number of minutes (autumn)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8222354Z   ok   spring and autumn UTC gaps are 15 minutes, plain day too
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8222510Z   ok   spring plan books no energy on a phantom step
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8222785Z   ok   autumn plan max gap is one 15-minute step
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8222921Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8223166Z -- window_factors across a transition INSIDE the horizon (#777)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8223383Z   ok   the transition really is inside the autumn and spring horizons
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8223615Z   ok   autumn fold: every window bills under the hour the meter keys it at
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8223847Z   ok   spring gap: every window bills under the hour the meter keys it at
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8224072Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the ordinary Saturday a week earlier never disagreed
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8224357Z   ok   and the comparison is not vacuous — both rates occur in every cell
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8224366Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8224542Z -- age seams across the DST transitions (#1299)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8224757Z   ok   a 2 h fold-night outage reads its true age, not the wall clock's
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8224967Z   ok   and crosses the 90-minute stale floor a 2 h outage must cross
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8225144Z   ok   weather staleness across the fold is the true 2 h
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8225358Z   ok   spring gap: the plan age is the true 2 h, not 3 h of wall clock
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8225632Z   ok   spring gap: weather staleness is the true 2 h
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8225824Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night's ages were always true
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8226047Z   ok   a backward clock step publishes 0 h staleness, not a negative age
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8226221Z   ok   the plan age stays clamped at 0 after the same step
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8226441Z   ok   a fold-night handover 2 h old is refused against a 60-min window
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8226663Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain-night 2 h handover is refused identically
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8226863Z   ok   legionella hours_since reads true elapsed across the fold
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8227070Z   ok   the pump walks the plan by TRUE elapsed steps across the fold
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8227247Z   ok   and that agreement is the OFF the true index commands
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8227483Z   ok   the fold-night outage stamped its last-good at the pre-fold instant
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8227707Z   ok   a mode unreadable for a TRUE 3 h 20 min is expired, not held good
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8227934Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night expires the same-age mode identically
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8228133Z   ok   a defrost running the fold's true 2 h books 7200 s of duty
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8228308Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night books the same 7200 s
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8228510Z   ok   and a mixed naive/aware pair is still declined, not guessed
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8228518Z 
