2026-10-18T01:04:18.8373224Z   ok   a garbage store loads as empty rather than raising ({})
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8373409Z   ok   a garbage store loads as empty rather than raising ([])
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8373608Z   ok   a garbage store loads as empty rather than raising ('nope')
