2026-10-18T01:04:18.8513225Z   ok   and is the exact mirror of regression_rows: a worsening is not an improvement
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8513434Z   ok   a level metric is neither an improvement nor a regression
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8513688Z   ok   no metric is exempt from the ratchet: the two retired categories are gone
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8513937Z   ok   improvement_rows names cross_seam_edges like any other row when it falls
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8514173Z   ok   the ratchet FAILS on an improvement instead of printing a note (#350)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8514463Z   ok   and the improvement block names all three, so the author knows what to write down
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8514663Z   ok   and prints the exact runnable command, not just the numbers
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8514904Z   ok   and frames it as 'you made this better, write it down', not as a breach
