2026-10-18T01:04:18.8515355Z   ok   a worsening still fails, and still as a breach
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8515635Z   ok   headroom on cross_seam_edges alone is an unrecorded improvement, so the run fails
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8515872Z   ok   an unrecorded improvement is not a violation at the exit code (#808)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8516178Z   ok   with a breach in the same diff the improvement is still named but --record is not offered
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8516453Z   ok   table_maxima reports the worst row of each table measure() already sorts (#374)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8516716Z   ok   and it is a MAX, not the first row -- an unsorted table still reports the worst
