2026-10-18T01:04:18.8517405Z   ok   both are plain counts, so the existing current > budget arm handles them
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8517694Z   ok   one extra `and` clause inside a function costs exactly 1 of CC -- the vector, priced
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8517940Z   ok   and print_report prints both, so the evidence and the RESULT line agree
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8518216Z   ok   sum_cc is rejected IN THE CODE, with the reason and the issue it would break (#374)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8518483Z   ok   the dead-member census exempts the names HA looks up on an instance (#1395)
2026-10-18T01:04:18.8518786Z   ok   a @property nothing reads is a dead member; one a live member reads is not (D7-s3-02)
