2026-10-18T01:04:19.0070089Z === Manual plan override ===
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0070098Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0070233Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0070395Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0070593Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0070725Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0070820Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0070921Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0071054Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0071176Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0071298Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0071551Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0071685Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0071693Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0071807Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0071931Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0072070Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0072190Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0072344Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0072468Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0072614Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0073023Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0073187Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0073380Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0073561Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0073570Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0073698Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0074663Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0074818Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0074950Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0075087Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0075095Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0075234Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0075412Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0075561Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0075681Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0075816Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0075970Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0076197Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0076360Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0076509Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0076518Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0076714Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0076954Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0077153Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0077408Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0077416Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0077683Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0077941Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0078163Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0078449Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0078683Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0078867Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0078876Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0079113Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0079354Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0079524Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0079683Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0079839Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0079847Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0080036Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0080196Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0080318Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0080443Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0080661Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0080939Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0081072Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0081220Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0081436Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0081578Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0081719Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0081926Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0082182Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0082375Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0082578Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0083055Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0083299Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0083658Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0083889Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0084095Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0084278Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0084527Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0084775Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0085036Z   ok   an off window overlapping a silent window is refused even with no hot water
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0085196Z   ok   an off window overlapping hot water is refused
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0085434Z   ok   a weekly quiet spec keeps its day selector through canonicalisation
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0085695Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0085908Z   ok   a service call whose off window overlaps hot water is refused
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0086147Z   ok   an Off mask with no other cap still zeroes exactly its own space steps
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0086410Z   ok   the plan sensor publishes the not-enforced marker and the resolved actions
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0086647Z   ok   configured_specs returns the stored rows and the not-enforced marker
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0086875Z   ok   the monthly peak sensor publishes the tariff fields it was given
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0087124Z   ok   the default silent fraction is the unset value the fold compares against
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0087134Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0087322Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0087553Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0087702Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0087891Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0088078Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0088253Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0088452Z   ok   forcing hot water off when the tank is hot releases nothing
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0088468Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0088656Z -- A timezone-less expiry is handled, not crashed on
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0088801Z   ok   a naive expiry does not raise TypeError
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0088981Z   ok   the stored expiry is comparable with the parsed slots
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0089162Z   ok   and the override can still be applied to the horizon
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0089353Z   ok   a naive expiry in the past is rejected as a plan error
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0089361Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0089587Z -- Abandoning an unsafe plan does not discard the safe channel
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0089723Z   ok   the breaching channel is abandoned
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0089895Z   ok   the channel that was never unsafe keeps its pins
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0090173Z   ok   so the space plan the user asked for still holds
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0090189Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0090422Z -- A released pin is never reported without being planned around
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0090581Z   ok   a plan that never converges still terminates
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0090726Z   ok   giving up releases every forced-off slot
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0090892Z   ok   the abandoned plan is as warm as planning freely
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0091051Z   ok   and it heats about as much as planning freely
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0091059Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0091207Z -- No override leaves behaviour unchanged
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0091400Z   ok   winter_dhw: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0091573Z   ok   winter_dhw: no pins means the override is inactive
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0091742Z   ok   summer: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0091904Z   ok   summer: no pins means the override is inactive
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0092074Z   ok   no_dhw: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0092309Z   ok   no_dhw: no pins means the override is inactive
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0092326Z 
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0092494Z -- Coordinator wiring, persistence and expiry
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0092841Z   ok   apply reports the pinned DHW step count
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0093035Z   ok   a slot late in the horizon is still counted
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0093254Z   ok   a slot past the window pins nothing, rather than pretending to
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0093480Z   ok   the manual-plan window is shorter than the optimisation horizon
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0093612Z   ok   an omitted channel produces no pins
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0093763Z   ok   a supplied channel produces aligned pins
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0093967Z   ok   the coordinator exposes the active override to the sensors
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0094120Z   ok   an override survives a restart within the day
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0094304Z   ok   an already-expired override is discarded on restore
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0094443Z   ok   an expired override yields no pins
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0094618Z   ok   an expired override is dropped from the coordinator
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0094802Z   ok   a rejected apply leaves the existing override intact
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0094965Z   ok   a stored list payload is discarded, not raised
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0095117Z   ok   a stored str payload is discarded, not raised
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0095274Z   ok   a stored int payload is discarded, not raised
2026-10-18T01:04:19.0095446Z   ok   the data dict omits manual_plan when none is active
